<title>UK: Mirror set to bid for Midland - paper.</title>
<headline>Mirror set to bid for Midland - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mirror Group Plc is expected to reveal a 285 million agreed bid for Midland Independent Newspapers Plc, the Times said on Friday.</p>
<p>The paper said the Mirror Group's offer is expected to be pitched at about 210p per share. Midland's shares closed at 189-1/2p on Thursday.</p>
<p>Midland also is expected to reveal that its forecast for this year's pr-tax profits is as much as 25 million the Times said. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
